      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Why three retrievers",
      "items": [
        "Vector finds paraphrases but misses rare proper nouns",
        "BM25 finds exact names but misses paraphrases",
        "Graph finds multi-hop structure neither can express"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Fusion by rank, not score",
      "items": [
        "Cosine, BM25 and adjacency are on incomparable scales",
        "RRF needs no normalisation and no tuning",
        "A memory found by two legs outranks one found by one"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "The coverage guarantee",
      "items": [
        "Rewarding agreement buries the leg that overlaps least",
        "Left alone, vector and keyword fill every slot",
